data: {"id": "6f0b8bbb86914c77-thinking-parallel_evidence-1533", "run_id": "6f0b8bbb86914c77", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好，首轮观测已确认：\n- Metrics: `CrashLoopBackOff`, `last_terminated_reason=Error`, `restarts=10`, `phase=Running`\n- Logging: 出现 `runtime process exiting`, `http_status=500`, 且带 trace_id（如 `1177dab7...`、`7b358697...`）\n- Tracing: Flow 和 Tempo span 已覆盖，span 属性含 `aiops.observed_mode: runtime_exit`，并返回了多个 trace_id\n\n这已经足够指向“业务逻辑异常导致进程主动退出”这条路径。现在按计划做 Kubernetes 侧验证：describe/pod yaml/previous logs，并选一个 trace_id 做 Tempo span 深挖。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788438280163, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

