data: {"id": "6f0b8bbb86914c77-thinking-parallel_evidence-2486", "run_id": "6f0b8bbb86914c77", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到的关键事实如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c`\n- **UID**: `20db72b2-f223-4295-8f2d-62edd54cf1cd` (Tracing/Topology日志中一致)\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **容器**: `app` (单容器Pod)\n- **Owner**: `ReplicaSet/workload-7679bcf76` -> `Deployment/workload`\n- **状态**: Phase为Running，但容器状态为`CrashLoopBackOff`，`restarts=10`，且最后退出码(exitCode)为2。\n\n### 2. 异常表现 (支持 CrashLoopBackOffRuntime)\n- **kubectl_describe**: 显示 Warning 事件 \"Back-off restarting failed container app\"，次数133次，持续30分钟。容器未就绪(Re", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788438320923, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

