rch 日志显示 4 次 `runtime process exiting` 错误，均关联 HTTP 请求 `path=/work` 且 `http_status=500`（事实编号 3）。Deepflow 流量日志显示 2 次 `GET /work` 返回 `response_code=500`，且 Trace ID `1177dab7b64a1e5b24692ffc4375aaf6` 同时在日志和跟踪中出现，形成闭环（事实编号 4）。\n3.  **排除资源问题**：应用内存使用量为 0，且非极低资源限制，使得 OOM 等外部资源驱逐可能性极低，指向应用内部逻辑或代码问题。\n\n**不足与未知：**\n*   缺乏具体的应用代码堆栈（Traceback），无法确定引发 `exit(2)` 的确切代码行或业务逻辑。\n*   Exit Code 2 的具体应用语义定义未知（通常表示通用错误，但可能因应用而异）。\n*   尽管有证据表明是内部错误，但具体导致“未捕获异常”的代码路径尚未明确（符合正式 RCA 中的 `unknowns`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 30.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 78.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 78.8s (Evidence 69.8s, RCA 8.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 125.231, "metrics": {"run_id": "6f0b8bbb86914c77", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 125.23682761192322, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.